 def _call_memory_ingest(args, config):
     """memory_ingest: every ingest rule (enum, dir/file, size, guard) is the
-    library's; this only checks the argument shapes this transport promises."""
+    library's; this only checks the argument shapes this transport promises.
+
+    `source_id` is deliberately NOT advertised here, even though the library
+    now accepts it. It is a storage key, not a document field: the CLI exposes
+    `--source-id` because a human is naming a source they can point at, while a
+    tool call here is made by a model that has no way to know which id a later
